### Example 2: HIE ADT Feed Integration (Inbound Events)

**Scenario**: Regional Health Information Exchange (HIE) publishes ADT (Admission/Discharge/Transfer) feeds for Medicaid members. Gainwell needs this data for care management and utilization tracking.

**Before (Polling)**:

```csharp
// Polling service runs every 15 minutes
[CronJob("*/15 * * * *")]
public async Task PollHieForAdtUpdatesAsync()
{
    var lastPollTime = await _state.GetLastPollTimeAsync("HIE_ADT");

    // Poll HIE API for ADT updates since last poll
    var adtRecords = await _hieClient.GetAdtUpdatesAsync(new AdtQuery
    {
        Since = lastPollTime,
        MaxResults = 1000
    });

    // 99% of polls return zero results - wasted API calls
    if (!adtRecords.Any())
    {
        _logger.LogInformation("No ADT updates from HIE");
        return;
    }

    foreach (var adt in adtRecords)
    {
        await ProcessAdtRecordAsync(adt);
    }

    await _state.UpdateLastPollTimeAsync("HIE_ADT", DateTime.UtcNow);
}
```

**Problems**:
- 15-minute average latency for ADT notifications
- 99% of API calls return no data
- HIE rate limits causing missed updates
- No notification when critical admission occurs

**After (Event-Driven with Webhook)**:

```csharp
// HIE sends webhook to Gainwell when ADT occurs
[ApiController]
[Route("api/integration/hie/adt")]
public class HieAdtWebhookController : ControllerBase
{
    [HttpPost]
    [Authorize(Policy = "HIEPartnerAuth")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> ReceiveAdtNotificationAsync(
        [FromBody] HieAdtNotification notification)
    {
        // Validate webhook signature
        if (!await ValidateHieSignatureAsync(Request))
        {
            return Unauthorized();
        }

        // Transform HIE ADT format to internal event
        var internalEvent = new MemberAdmissionEvent
        {
            EventId = notification.MessageId,
            EventType = "com.gainwell.member.admitted.v1",
            OccurredAt = notification.EventTime,
            Data = new
            {
                MemberId = notification.PatientMedicaidId,
                FacilityId = notification.FacilityNpi,
                AdmissionDate = notification.AdmissionDateTime,
                AdmissionType = notification.AdmissionType,
                DiagnosisCodes = notification.DiagnosisCodes,
                Source = "HIE"
            }
        };

        // Publish to internal event broker
        await _eventBus.PublishAsync("member-events", internalEvent);

        // Acknowledge receipt immediately
        return Accepted(new { messageId = notification.MessageId, status = "accepted" });
    }
}

// Care management service consumes admission events
public class CareManagementService : IConsumer<MemberAdmissionEvent>
{
    public async Task Consume(ConsumeContext<MemberAdmissionEvent> context)
    {
        var evt = context.Message;

        // Check if member requires care management outreach
        var member = await _memberRepo.GetAsync(evt.Data.MemberId);
        if (member.RiskScore > 75)
        {
            // Create care management task within minutes of admission
            await _taskService.CreateAsync(new CareManagementTask
            {
                MemberId = member.Id,
                Type = "AdmissionFollowUp",
                Priority = "High",
                DueDate = DateTime.UtcNow.AddHours(24),
                Description = $"Member admitted to {evt.Data.FacilityId} - high risk score"
            });
        }
    }
}
```

**Outcomes**:
- **Near-real-time ADT notifications** (vs polling delay)
- **Eliminated unnecessary polling API calls** (webhook push vs polling)
- **Reduced API costs** for HIE integration
- **Care management tasks created promptly** after admission through event-driven notification
- Improved care coordination with near-real-time admission awareness

